llama.cpp (https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp)

The IQ4_NL and MXFP4 values and the IQ1, IQ2 and IQ3 grids in
runtime/metal/abi/QuantTables.h are ggml's kvalues_iq4nl, kvalues_mxfp4,
iq1s_grid_gpu, iq2xxs_grid, iq2xs_grid, iq2s_grid, iq3xxs_grid and iq3s_grid
(ggml/src/ggml-common.h), and the GGUF decoding in
runtime/metal/kernels/common/quant_formats.h and the GGUF kernels built on it
follow ggml's Metal dequantize.h and mul_mm.metal. They are compiled into
splash.metallib. The tests' CPU reference,
dev/tests/engine/GgufFormatReference.hpp, decodes the same blocks as ggml's
dequantize_row_* (ggml/src/ggml-quants.c).

